OL,3,GNEWSAPeriod products 'essential not
OL,4,Aoptional'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSanitary towels and tampons are "basic
OL,7,Fhealth and hygiene products" which are
OL,8,F"essential and not optional", the
OL,9,Fpublic health director has said.
OL,11,FMatt Tyrer's department is spearheading
OL,12,Fthe rolling out of a scheme which will
OL,13,Fsee women and girls on the Isle of Man
OL,14,Faccess free period products.
OL,16,FThe Period Products (free provision)
OL,17,FAct bill was introduced by MHK Joney
OL,18,FFaragher as a private members bill in
OL,19,F2024. It has now been given Royal
OL,20,FAssent but it will not come into force
OL,21,Funtil October 2027.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
